== Non-passenger and specialty plates ==
Alabama offers a variety of optional plates that motorists may display upon the payment of an additional fee as well as non-passenger plate types that are displayed on vehicles for specialized uses.<ref>[https://web.archive.org/web/20050531003059/http://www.revenue.alabama.gov/motorvehicle/index.html Alabama Department of Revenue Motor Vehicle Division].</ref>

=== Non-passenger types ===
Many non-passenger types are both county-coded and weight-coded. Where noted, the county code is the first one or two regularly sized number of the serial, while the weight code is a small number beneath the letter that indicates the vehicle type.

